# Eski mahalliy fayllar — git'da YO'Q va bo'lmasligi ham kerak.
#
# Ular `tsc` va `build` ni yiqitadi (`@/types/domain` da yo'q
# tiplar, `@/features/warehouse/types` yo'q modul). Mahalliy
# diskda qolgan, lekin loyihaga tegishli emas.
#
# Bir marta ular tasodifan commit'ga tushib ketdi va CI qizardi —
# shuning uchun endi ataylab e'tiborsiz qoldiriladi.
/src/features/products/
/src/lib/uzum.ts
/src/data/
/src/app/api/
/src/components/charts/

# Xuddi shu narsa 2026-09-06 da QAYTA sodir bo'ldi: 25 ta eski
# fayl commit'ga tushib, CI qizardi (`Cannot find module
# '@/data/products'`, `'@/components/charts/sparkline'`,
# `'../date-range'`, `../store`da yo'q eksportlar) va deploy
# o'tmadi. Ular ham shu ro'yxatga qo'shildi.
#
# Papka darajasida — butunlay o'lik bo'limlar:
/src/app/(dashboard)/boost/
/src/app/(dashboard)/brands/
/src/app/(dashboard)/categories/
/src/app/(dashboard)/competitors/
/src/app/(dashboard)/dashboard/
/src/app/(dashboard)/keywords/
/src/app/(dashboard)/lost-products/
/src/app/(dashboard)/monitoring/
/src/app/(dashboard)/opportunities/
/src/app/(dashboard)/photo-search/
/src/app/(dashboard)/products/
/src/app/(dashboard)/reviews/
/src/app/(dashboard)/sellers/
/src/app/(dashboard)/trends/
#
# Fayl darajasida — TIRIK papkalar ichidagi o'lik fayllar
# (`components/ui`, `components/dashboard`, `features/*` da
# ishlatilayotgan fayllar ham bor, shuning uchun papka emas):
/src/components/dashboard/ai-insights.tsx
/src/components/dashboard/heatmap-cell.tsx
/src/components/dashboard/kpi-card.tsx
/src/components/dashboard/kpi-strip-item.tsx
/src/components/dashboard/score-gauge.tsx
/src/components/ui/progress.tsx
/src/components/ui/scroll-area.tsx
/src/features/finance/components/date-range-picker.tsx
/src/features/warehouse/components/warehouse-table.tsx
/src/features/warehouse/types.ts
#
# Kelajakda shu yo'llardan biri HAQIQATAN kerak bo'lsa:
# `git add -f <fayl>` — e'tiborsizlik ataylab, taqiq emas.
